OL,3,GNEWSAForest wildfire hit road to remain
OL,4,Ashut until weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major New Forest road at the heart of
OL,7,Fa wildfire will remain closed for
OL,8,Frepairs until the weekend.
OL,10,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,11,Fvan fire on the A31 near Ringwood on 9
OL,12,FAugust went on to destroy about 1.6 sq
OL,13,Fkm (0.6 sq miles) of heathland.
OL,15,FThe dual carriageway has been closed
OL,16,Fsince the fire started and National
OL,17,FHighways confirmed the main route
OL,18,Fbetween Bournemouth and Southampton
OL,19,Fwill remain shut until the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
